WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.291
Today we will appreciate work using evidence. Our work connects with other Ghanaian

00:00:05.291 --> 00:00:05.683
communities.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:09.669
Describe visible lines, colours, textures and shapes.

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:13.627
Say which details help communicate the artist’s idea.

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:18.951
Give one evidence-based compliment and one possible improvement. Compare your result

00:00:18.951 --> 00:00:21.360
with a second example from Ghana.
